elements.description:
Public-safe project reference, dated 8 October 2026. This is an ordinary Kumu data import, not a project backup. Architecture and milestones describe proposed or planned work unless their Status explicitly says otherwise. Implementation is in progress. The storage/API foundation has passed 13 automated tests; UI and end-to-end acceptance remain incomplete. Approved REA setup is installed and its standalone server has been verified, while active-session tool reload remains pending.

Use Overview for the architecture, Roadmap for prerequisite arrows, and Review for gates, decisions and blockers. An arrow labeled "prerequisite for" points from the prerequisite to the dependent milestone. Other arrows describe their own relationship. Details and acceptance criteria are in each element profile.

Fields separate work Status from Evidence level. A verified baseline is confined to the pinned audit commit; a documented or observed Kumu capability does not establish Sensemaker implementation. The map is a snapshot, not a live status feed. No original private transcript quotations are included.

Safe first import: export a JSON backup of the existing project, then create a new empty map named Sensemaker reference 2026-10-08. Choose the Stakeholder template for automatic positioning. Disable clustering and use the ordinary JSON file import. Expect 42 elements and 60 connections. Review pending changes; if existing items would be updated unexpectedly, cancel. Save only the intended new import. Do not use project-backup restore or delete existing content. IDs use the dedicated ppsref20261008- namespace, but existing-project collisions have not been checked. Reimporting the same IDs can overwrite fields across maps.

To create focused views, make a NEW view rather than editing an existing one, then use the corresponding Advanced Editor settings below. These settings are based on official documentation but have not been applied or tested in the real project. Color by Type in the Basic Editor if desired.

Overview:
```
@settings {
  include: element["tags"*="Overview"], connection["tags"*="Overview"];
}
```

Roadmap:
```
@settings {
  include: element["tags"*="Roadmap"], connection["tags"*="Roadmap"];
}
```

Review:
```
@settings {
  include: element["tags"*="Review"], connection["tags"*="Review"];
}
```

References: [Kumu JSON imports](https://docs.kumu.io/guides/import/blueprints) · [Map templates](https://docs.kumu.io/getting-started/first-steps) · [Import ID rules](https://docs.kumu.io/frequently-asked-questions/how-do-i-avoid-duplicating-data) · [Views](https://docs.kumu.io/guides/views) · [Filters](https://docs.kumu.io/guides/filter)
